{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/extras/Discord_steam_2-01.png?t=1746708533\" /><br> <br><strong>Unleash your inner ass-kicking menace in this unique \u201cFirst-Person Booter\u201d. Step into the boot of Glum, the crude, short-tempered goblin, and kick, cuss and fight your way through a vibrant and physics-based world that - unlike your average Sunday morning cartoon - is not suited for sticky children.  </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>GLUM is a game where one man\u2019s tragedy is another man\u2019s comedy.  </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kick-ass Physics Combat </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our physics-based combat system ensures that every enemy you take down reacts dynamically, meaning glorious, over-the-top ragdoll chaos. Smash, launch, and obliterate foes in ways that are as satisfying as they are hilarious.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/extras/ny_frame_rate_duck_gif.gif?t=1746708533\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Menace Style System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn style points for creative kills! Whether you\u2019re flinging explosive barrels and magical potions at your enemies, or getting up close and personal, the menace actions and points amplifies flair for destruction and creative sadism! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wacky Exploration &amp; Collectables </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GLUM\u2019s crude humor is scattered around the environments of the game, making those hidden spots and cheeky collectables worth every moment of exploring.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/extras/ny_gnome.gif?t=1746708533\" />All you need to know is that there has been a coup and Glum\u2019s overlord, Semperius, has been mysteriously captured by rivaling overlords. Although Glum has lived his sorry excuse of a life being the underling of one particularly mean Overlord, the Overlord\u2019s kidnapping forces Glum to dust off an old magical boot and unleash his main character energy in his search for vengeance (and the return of a stable income).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2235550?t=1746708533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746708533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/e893e53c2b43dcd2bc5ea4579d4018df4e8f2ace/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746708533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/e893e53c2b43dcd2bc5ea4579d4018df4e8f2ace/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746708533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Glum:  features bloody violence, gore in a cartoony setting and strong language. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/extras/Discord_steam_2-01.png?t=1746708533\" /><br> <br><strong>Unleash your inner ass-kicking menace in this unique \u201cFirst-Person Booter\u201d. Step into the boot of Glum, the crude, short-tempered goblin, and kick, cuss and fight your way through a vibrant and physics-based world that - unlike your average Sunday morning cartoon - is not suited for sticky children.  </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>GLUM is a game where one man\u2019s tragedy is another man\u2019s comedy.  </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kick-ass Physics Combat </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our physics-based combat system ensures that every enemy you take down reacts dynamically, meaning glorious, over-the-top ragdoll chaos. Smash, launch, and obliterate foes in ways that are as satisfying as they are hilarious.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/extras/ny_frame_rate_duck_gif.gif?t=1746708533\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Menace Style System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn style points for creative kills! Whether you\u2019re flinging explosive barrels and magical potions at your enemies, or getting up close and personal, the menace actions and points amplifies flair for destruction and creative sadism! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wacky Exploration &amp; Collectables </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GLUM\u2019s crude humor is scattered around the environments of the game, making those hidden spots and cheeky collectables worth every moment of exploring.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/extras/ny_gnome.gif?t=1746708533\" />All you need to know is that there has been a coup and Glum\u2019s overlord, Semperius, has been mysteriously captured by rivaling overlords. Although Glum has lived his sorry excuse of a life being the underling of one particularly mean Overlord, the Overlord\u2019s kidnapping forces Glum to dust off an old magical boot and unleash his main character energy in his search for vengeance (and the return of a stable income).</p>","developers":["CinderCat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235550/header.jpg?t=1746708533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133396,"mp4":{"480":"h